# Week 9: Security and monitoring

**Date:** 7 Dec (draft; confirm time and venue in the track channel)

**Goal:** Harden your project and make it observable.

## Learning objectives
By the end you should be able to:
- Apply least privilege to IAM
- Store secrets properly
- Read audit logs
- Create a useful alert

## Before the session
- [ ] A deployed project
- [ ] Read [Stage 5](../../learning-path/05-security-and-observability.md)

## Agenda
1. Common cloud security mistakes (20 min)
2. IAM and service accounts (20 min)
3. Secrets, logging and monitoring (30 min)
4. Peer review of projects (20 min)

## Hands-on reference
Use the [cloud security checklist](../../resources/cloud-security-checklist.md) to review your own project, then swap with another team.

## 🏁 Take-home challenge
- [ ] Complete the checklist for your capstone and fix what you find
- [ ] Create one alert
- [ ] Review another team's project and leave kind, specific feedback

Post your result or questions in the track channel, or open an issue.

